{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/900805-indulge-my-vanity-help-me-choose-a-new-username","id":900805,"title":"[Indulge My Vanity] Help me choose a new username!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-27T03:14:35-07:00","id":900805,"title":"[Indulge My Vanity] Help me choose a new username!","content":"So, I've been Claire Redfield here and <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/member.php?87917-Claire-Redfield\" target=\"_blank\">on RPGnet</a> (as well as other places around the web) for a long time. Lately I am thinking of a change. I love mythical things, goddesses, angels (particularly the Magic-style, non-Christian-centered kind), dinosaurs, the colors blue and white, and things like phoenixes, dragons, etc. So, I am considering something along those lines. I've been brainstorming various ideas from silly to, well, sillier, but it's sort of hard to come up with one. Here are a few examples and variations in a sort of stream-of-consciousness kind of way:<br /> <br /> Seraph<br /> Blue Seraph<br /> Six-Winged Seraph<br /> <br /> Firebird<br /> Firebird Femme (hah! Kinda like this one) (Femme Firebird?)<br /> Firebird Halo (could work, too)<br /> Dinosaur Queen (what? I love dinosaurs!)<br /> <br /> Hm. Calls to mind... phoenix-winged angel? Angel-winged phoenix? A dino-phoenix with angel wings? Wait, my novel has something like that...well, hm. Lots more choices, of course. I guess I'll have to retire to meditate upon this beneath a waterfall. In the meantime, if one variation or idea seems cooler than another, let me know. I need help! I'm indecisive! Rawr!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://foru