,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-27T10:48:23-07:00","id":901152,"title":"","content":"Corona is definitely a good word to fit in there. It's got associations both with fire and halos.<br /> <br /> If you want to go really MTG style with it, you could construct a Legendary Creature name for yourself. Something like &quot;Corona, the Flaming Seraph&quot;. Might be a bit long for a foum username though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-27T11:29:23-07:00","id":901198,"title":"","content":"I honestly think Phoenix Angel sounds like an awesome Magic card, so maybe that? Though Firebird Femme or Femme Firebird are both incredibly hard to pass up...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-27T21:45:43-07:00","id":901730,"title":"","content":"Phoenix Angel would be awesome.<br /> <br /> I invented a phoenix-dinosaur guardinal (celestial sorta-angelic being) for Planescape once, but I can't do D&amp;D crunch so I never gave it